  "notes": "Gottlieb System 80 Step 18 switch test per the Black Hole manual page 13, part c of three (matrix addresses 54-77). Self/Test (07) and Credit (47) enter Step 16, two more Self/Test presses advance through Step 17 to Step 18, where the status (ball-in-play) display reads 99 with every switch open and shows a closed switch's assigned matrix number. The ROM holds each reported number for about 4.4 s and leaves the test after about two and a half minutes, so the 62 addresses 00-77 other than 07 (Self/Test) and 47 (Credit) are split over three runs and each is closed alone for 5 s with a 1.5 s gap. Direct switch writes only; nothing is held from boot.",
